# ENGINE_4 -- Audit

Self-review before verify/package. Command: `/audit-task`. Does not write
the zip.

## Must run

```bash
python3 scripts/validate_odyssey_task.py --slug <slug>
python3 scripts/scan_bundle_leaks.py --slug <slug>
python3 scripts/check_difficulty_design.py --slug <slug>
python3 scripts/check_novelty.py --slug <slug>
```

Quote real output. SKIPPED is unknown, not passing.

## Difficulty audit table (fill every row)

| Item | Verdict |
|---|---|
| Remaining work is a complete system (>= 40 expert hours) | PASS/FAIL |
| Instruction is a scenario, not a recipe | PASS/FAIL |
| Visible weight < 50% (aim ~30%) | PASS/FAIL |
| Hidden failure mode != visible | PASS/FAIL |
| Generated/property hidden channel | PASS/FAIL |
| Decoy off hot path, or justified none | PASS/FAIL |
| Probe V (visible-only) still fails hidden | PASS/FAIL / not run |
| Probe D (decoy-only) still fails hidden | PASS/FAIL / N/A / not run |
| Probe L (one layer) still fails later hidden | PASS/FAIL / not run |
| Probe A (almost-correct) fails hidden | PASS/FAIL / not run |
| Decorative hardening (extra fields/tests, same bugs) | absent/present |
| `difficultyExplanation` names first-attempt trap | PASS/FAIL |

Any FAIL or "not run" on V -> not ready. Decorative present -> ENGINE_8, not
more pytest.

